Podcasty — Android Podcast Player
Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).

This application adapts the Android Jetpack Compose visual design, UI component
architecture, liquid-glass navigation chrome, adaptive fullscreen player layouts,
and living artwork shader from Airmedy (https://github.com/misa198/airmedy) by
misa198, licensed under GNU GPL v3.0. All music-specific functionality has been
replaced with podcast playback, local podcast library management, Room & DataStore
persistence, and AndroidX Media3 / ExoPlayer integration.

